ype":"paragraph"}],"name":"timeout"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session events to track; both by default. Leaving one out, or both, tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none of that kind, and every record still carries its session’s key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"kinds"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"file"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"fileID"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"function"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"line"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default."}]}],"name":"column"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is put in a session until the app turns it on, among the enrichers it builds its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApplicationOpened"},{"type":"text","text":" (module"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LifecycleTracking"},{"type":"text","text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" comes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout: "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session ends with no "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":